  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlgebraically convert the equation from part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e into point–slope form, and then graph it on your calculator. Also, enter the coordinates of the four points you found in parts \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eb \u003c/b\u003ein L\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e and L\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e, and plot the points on the graph.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eStarting with 15\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e + 44\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 62, subtract 15\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e from both sides.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eStarting with 15\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e + 44\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 62, subtract 15\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e from both sides.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"112\" height\u003d\"21\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_6c_90/image008.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide through by 44.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eDivide through by 44.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"105\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_6c_90/image009.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSince we\u0027re using a calculator, we don\u0027t really need to simplify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21082\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21082\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the function as Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e. Key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21083\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qnegative.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21083\u0026quot;,189)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21084\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qopenparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21084\u0026quot;,196)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21085\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21086\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21087\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdivide.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21087\u0026quot;,133)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21088\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21089\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21090\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcloseparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21090\u0026quot;,121)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21091\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21091\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg