      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eWhat would be an appropriate viewing window for this graph?\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4696\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_0\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4697\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_1\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –1, Ymax \u003d 1, Yscl \u003d 0.1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4698\u0027,\u0027yes\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_2\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –70, Xmax \u003d 70, Xscl \u003d 10, Ymin \u003d –25, Ymax \u003d 25, Yscl \u003d 5\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe need to show the points from parts \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003eb\u003c/b\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"221\" height\u003d\"64\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_6c_90/image010.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21100\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21100\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e and set Xmin \u003d –70, Xmax \u003d 70, Xscl \u003d 10, Ymin \u003d –25, Ymax \u003d 25, Yscl \u003d 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_6c_90/f-90-6c-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21101\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qlist.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21101\u0026quot;,175)\"\u003e and enter the \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e–coordinates of the points.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
